<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> came over, and after that I </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="い">made</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> tea, and we watched a DVD together.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just like this. If we stay together like this the whole time, it'll be fine.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But today of all days, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> seemed to be feeling well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That's a good thing, but this way, even if I call </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> over, I can't talk to her about it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> never out of my sight, and me able to talk about the curse with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... a situation like that...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">As I thought, setting up the ideal conditions was hard.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\空撮.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">After that, I learned from the online news about an incident that had happened at Central Park.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It couldn't be... the curse can't have anything to do with it. Probably...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I let a frightened </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> lie down on the sofa, and checked the high school's message board.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\掲示板.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">What I found out was,</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・The victim was in a gruesome state</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・The victim was still alive when found</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That was about it.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">What bothered me most was that the body had been in such a gruesome state.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Leaving someone alive and half-dead was entirely possible.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Once she was awake, I asked </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> about her </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, just in case.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Luckily, he was away on a business trip to Hokkaido right now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In that case, whoever was killed must be someone else.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">In that case, who had been killed?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> was right here, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi's mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had called to say she'd be home late.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And her </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was away on business.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">Questions kept welling up one after another, and I wanted </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s help all the more</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But with </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> right in front of me...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even as I sat here, time was slipping away.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No, let's look at it differently. There are two things I can do right now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">One is to take </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> to Central Park, see the scene for myself, and look for a way to protect </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> would hate it, but that's better than having her die.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The other is to call </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> over here and consult her on the very question of 'how can I set up a situation to consult her.'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Natsumi<STYLE ID="6"> might go to the bathroom, say, and then,</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="7"> can't leave my sight, but I need to talk to you without her hearing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">I just have to say something like that.</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> This would only take a moment.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I can't tell which situation would work better.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is bound to be an important choice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Now, which do I pick?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> to the park, or </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> over here.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Okay... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s the one I'll call.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Knowing her</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, she's sure to be sniffing around about the incident.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I can also get information about the incident out of </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'll lure </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> over with pizza.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="7">, since we're ordering pizza anyway, why don't we invite </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Huh? But wouldn't <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> just eat all the pizza by herself?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That was </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">'s joke. I picked up my phone right away.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青切.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青入.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Hello, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">? What are you doing right now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ooh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! What do you think I'm doing right now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Sniffing around about the incident, I bet. Come over to my place and I'll feed you pizza!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"What! You guessed not just what I'm doing but my appetite too!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Aha, I see, I see. </STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="3"> on her own wasn't enough company, so you called on this genius girl, Erina Goto, too. Is that the way of it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　But I can probably only stay about an hour, okay? I've got cram school after this!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Got it! </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="7">'s here too, of course. Okay, I'll be waiting!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青切.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\インターホン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "900" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島万歳.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "五島.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―15 minutes later, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> showed up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Senpais! Good morning! I heard a rumor that things are lonely without Goto, so I have come flying over!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Oh, glad you came! Sit anywhere."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Pardon me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> said that and plopped down on the sofa.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"So? So? Where's the pizza?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was looking all around, her nose twitching.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Haven't ordered yet. Figured we might as well get your opinion too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"No need to be so considerate! I'm not picky, I'll eat anything!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Heh heh, you were thinking, 'If they were going to order anyway, they should've just ordered anything already,' right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh...! Just what I'd expect from </STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="3">! You know me well indeed!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> said that and grinned.</STYLE><PG>
"But <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>, you've got cram school after this, right? If we order pizza now, it won't get here in time, will it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Ah...! Now that you mention it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Y-you </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="はか">tricked</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> me...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, sorry... I honestly just forgot..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Well! In that case, I'll let you off with three Premium Seafood Sets at Sakura Sushi next time!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Are you trying to bankrupt the Niimura household!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> coming over on her own was enough to make it this lively.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Up until a minute ago </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> had seemed anxious, but as far as the mood went, we were okay.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE>, I'm borrowing your bathroom."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">All right, my chance came already! While she's gone, I'll just tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, "There's something I want to talk about, just the two of us."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Yeah, what's up?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Why did you call me here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was still smiling, but her eyes weren't.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Whenever she's like this, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has some kind of suspicion about me.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">She must have picked up on something...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If she has picked up on something, that works in my favor.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, hang on a sec."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I stood outside the bathroom door.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="7">, sorry, but could you bring over some DVDs, whatever ones? I'd like something to kill time with after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Rogerrr!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Good, that should buy me some time.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">It means taking my eyes off her for a bit, but only for 1 or 2 minutes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Having come this far, I had to be ready for a bit of a tightrope walk.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. You asked why I called you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes! </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you actually want to ask me something, don't you? Something you can't ask in front of </STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A smile that never slipped from </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s face, and a piercing gaze.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Words that seemed to see right through me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Um, well..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, for you of all people, pizza's the last thing on your mind, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Here was my chance to get information straight out of </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and I hadn't even thought about what to say.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even if I said that I'm a witch and might have put a curse on </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I won't dismiss anything you say. So please, ask what you want to ask, just as it is."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What on earth did </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> see to say a thing like that...! Did she get some information at Central Park?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
